{
  "formatVersion": 1,
  "id": "starter-kestrel-reach",
  "name": "Kestrel Reach",
  "description": "A grey, airless moon under a black sky, where the sun is a hard white disc and a banded giant planet fills a quarter of the horizon. Nothing makes a sound outside, footprints last for years in the fine dust, and everyone moves in long, slow bounds. Settlements huddle under domes and in buried halls, linked by pressurised crawlers.",
  "cover": "data:image/jpeg;base64,",
